{"1965950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fatal Nights", "steam_appid": 1965950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/extras/710c06f3120f6c1ac9699c68e22b41df.avif?t=1784085426\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatal Nights</strong> is a first-person survival horror mystery set in <strong>Burntwood</strong>, a quiet rural town in Eastern Oklahoma where the woods are too close, the locals are too careful, and something is very wrong beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Mason</strong>, a novice paranormal investigator from Guthrie, Oklahoma, who temporarily moves into a rental house on the edge of town to investigate Burntwood’s strange reports, local haunts, and unexplained activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it is the kind of work Mason understands: old houses, local rumors, nervous witnesses, strange sounds in the dark. But when a brutal murder shakes the town and disturbing notes begin appearing under the name <strong>“The Wendigo,”</strong> Mason’s investigation turns into something far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a small 1990s rural town, speak with guarded locals, search forgotten places, follow physical clues, manage your supplies, and decide how far you are willing to dig when folklore, madness, and reality begin to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/extras/a7cba108b7936276f875ba0987a29a6a.avif?t=1784085426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/extras_big/a7cba108b7936276f875ba0987a29a6a.avif?t=1784085426 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Burntwood, fear has roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town has its secrets.<br>The woods have their warnings.<br>And not every monster is hiding in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a grounded rural horror mystery set in the early 1990s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Burntwood, including rental homes, back roads, woods, old local sites, and rumored haunted places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with locals to earn trust, uncover leads, and piece together conflicting stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow clues through notes, records, environmental details, and physical investigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage supplies as the town becomes more dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a slow-burn horror story where human evil, local folklore, and something older begin to overlap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo-developed indie survival horror mystery.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/extras/710c06f3120f6c1ac9699c68e22b41df.avif?t=1784085426\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatal Nights</strong> is a first-person survival horror mystery set in <strong>Burntwood</strong>, a quiet rural town in Eastern Oklahoma where the woods are too close, the locals are too careful, and something is very wrong beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Mason</strong>, a novice paranormal investigator from Guthrie, Oklahoma, who temporarily moves into a rental house on the edge of town to investigate Burntwood’s strange reports, local haunts, and unexplained activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it is the kind of work Mason understands: old houses, local rumors, nervous witnesses, strange sounds in the dark. But when a brutal murder shakes the town and disturbing notes begin appearing under the name <strong>“The Wendigo,”</strong> Mason’s investigation turns into something far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a small 1990s rural town, speak with guarded locals, search forgotten places, follow physical clues, manage your supplies, and decide how far you are willing to dig when folklore, madness, and reality begin to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/extras/a7cba108b7936276f875ba0987a29a6a.avif?t=1784085426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/extras_big/a7cba108b7936276f875ba0987a29a6a.avif?t=1784085426 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Burntwood, fear has roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town has its secrets.<br>The woods have their warnings.<br>And not every monster is hiding in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a grounded rural horror mystery set in the early 1990s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Burntwood, including rental homes, back roads, woods, old local sites, and rumored haunted places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with locals to earn trust, uncover leads, and piece together conflicting stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow clues through notes, records, environmental details, and physical investigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage supplies as the town becomes more dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a slow-burn horror story where human evil, local folklore, and something older begin to overlap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo-developed indie survival horror mystery.</p>", "short_description": "A first-person survival horror mystery set in Burntwood, a quiet 1990s rural town where a paranormal investigation turns into something far worse. Search local haunts, question guarded townsfolk, follow physical clues, manage your supplies, and uncover what Burntwood is hiding.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/35a6c65722e055acd2b2df1b8a36d684bb82d5ef/header.jpg?t=1784085426", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/092a4c3bc11ca951282325221cb9c0dd75b05677/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784085426", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965950/092a4c3bc11ca951282325221cb9c0dd75b05677/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784085426", "website": "http://theendstudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti 2 GB or AMD Radeon R7 370 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 720p, Low settings, 30 FPS target</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><